.TH bhtune-template-export 1  "bhtune-template-export " 
.SH NAME
bhtune\-template\-export \- Export a template to a file, e.g. as a starting point for a site\-specific copy or a community catalog contribution
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbhtune\-template\-export\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> <\fIPATH\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export a template to a file, e.g. as a starting point for a site\-specific copy or a community catalog contribution
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: json]
File format to write. `toml` emits a single\-entry `[[template]]` catalog block, ready to paste into a catalog file or open as a contribution pull request
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
toml
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>

.TP
<\fIPATH\fR>

